\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0 God, we do present our treasures
\par     as an offering to you     \i\tab\i0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 It is your love that commands us
\par To serve other people.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thou who made the first offering
\par In our Lord Jesus Christ,
\par Teach us to dedicate ourselves
\par All the days of our lives.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  The poor are expectant of us,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 To demonstrate our love,
\par And how we serve with all our lives,
\par For one's comfort and peace.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par The church of Christ is calling us,
\par His wishes to obey.
\par Mankind will love one another
\par \pard     And shall become renew'd.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

